#: autonick.py:23
msgid ""
"Lets users set their nickname by sending a message in a configured channel.\n"
"    The name is checked to block swear words and forbidden names (including dictators and celebrities).\n"
"\n"
"    Available commands (slash or prefix):\n"
"      • /autonick setchannel\n"
"      • /autonick setcooldown\n"
"      • /autonick info\n"
"      • /autonick admin addforbidden\n"
"      • /autonick admin removeforbidden\n"
"      • /autonick admin listforbidden\n"
"    "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"    Cog que permite a los usuarios establecer su apodo mediante el envío de un mensaje en un canal configurado.\n"
"    Se valida el contenido del nombre para evitar palabrotas y nombres prohibidos (incluyendo dictadores y famosos).\n"
"\n"
"    Comandos disponibles (como slash o prefijo):\n"
"      • /autonick setchannel\n"
"      • /autonick setcooldown\n"
"      • /autonick info\n"
"      • /autonick admin addforbidden\n"
"      • /autonick admin removeforbidden\n"
"      • /autonick admin listforbidden\n"
"    "

#: autonick.py:119
msgid ""
"{author}, you must wait {remaining} seconds before changing your nickname "
"again."
msgstr ""
"{author}, debes esperar {remaining} segundos antes de cambiar tu apodo "
"nuevamente."

#: autonick.py:131
msgid "{author}, the nickname can't be longer than 32 characters."
msgstr "{author}, el apodo no puede tener mas de 32 caracteres."

#: autonick.py:138
msgid ""
"{author}, that name contains forbidden words or names. Please choose another"
" one."
msgstr ""
"{author}, el nombre contiene palabras o nombres no permitidos. Por favor, "
"elige otro."

#: autonick.py:147
msgid "{author}, your nickname has been changed to: **{escape_markdown}**"
msgstr "{author}, tu apodo ha sido cambiado a: **{escape_markdown}**"

#: autonick.py:152
msgid "{author}, I don't have permission to change your nickname."
msgstr "{author}, no tengo permisos para cambiar tu apodo."

#: autonick.py:155
msgid "Error while changing the nickname: {e}"
msgstr "Error al cambiar el apodo: {e}"

#: autonick.py:168
msgid ""
"Set the channel where nickname messages are read.\n"
"        Example: `/autonick setchannel #channel-name`\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"        Establece el canal donde se escucharán los mensajes para cambiar el apodo.\n"
"        Ejemplo: `/autonick setchannel #nombre-del-canal`\n"
"        "

#: autonick.py:172
msgid "The AutoNick channel has been set to {channel}."
msgstr "El canal para AutoNick ha sido establecido a {channel}."

#: autonick.py:177
msgid ""
"Set the cooldown (in seconds) between nickname changes.\n"
"        Example: `/autonick setcooldown 30`\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"        Establece el cooldown (en segundos) entre cambios de apodo.\n"
"        Ejemplo: `/autonick setcooldown 30`\n"
"        "

#: autonick.py:181
msgid "The cooldown must be a positive number."
msgstr "El cooldown debe ser un número positivo."

#: autonick.py:183
msgid "The cooldown has been set to {seconds} seconds."
msgstr "El cooldown ha sido establecido a {seconds} segundos."

#: autonick.py:187
msgid ""
"Show the current AutoNick settings.\n"
"        Example: `/autonick info`\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"        Muestra la configuración actual del cog AutoNick.\n"
"        Ejemplo: `/autonick info`\n"
"        "

#: autonick.py:193
msgid "AutoNick settings"
msgstr "Configuración de AutoNick"

#: autonick.py:194
msgid "Channel"
msgstr "Canal"

#: autonick.py:194
msgid "Not set"
msgstr "No configurado"

#: autonick.py:195
msgid "Cooldown"
msgstr "Cooldown"

#: autonick.py:195
msgid "{cooldown} seconds"
msgstr "{cooldown} segundos"

#: autonick.py:201
msgid ""
"AutoNick admin commands.\n"
"        Usage: `/autonick admin <subcommand>`\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"        Comandos administrativos para AutoNick.\n"
"        Uso: `/autonick admin <subcomando>`\n"
"        "

#: autonick.py:210
msgid ""
"Add a word or phrase to the forbidden names list.\n"
"        Example: `/autonick admin addforbidden [word or phrase]`\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"        Añade una palabra o frase a la lista de nombres prohibidos.\n"
"        Ejemplo: `/autonick admin addforbidden [palabra o frase]`\n"
"        "

#: autonick.py:216
msgid "That word is already in the forbidden list."
msgstr "Esa palabra ya se encuentra en la lista de prohibidos."

#: autonick.py:219
msgid "The word '{word}' has been added to the forbidden list."
msgstr "La palabra '{word}' ha sido añadida a la lista de prohibidos."

#: autonick.py:224
msgid ""
"Remove a word or phrase from the forbidden names list.\n"
"        Example: `/autonick admin removeforbidden [word or phrase]`\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"        Elimina una palabra o frase de la lista de nombres prohibidos.\n"
"        Ejemplo: `/autonick admin removeforbidden [palabra o frase]`\n"
"        "

#: autonick.py:230
msgid "That word is not in the forbidden list."
msgstr "Esa palabra no se encuentra en la lista de prohibidos."

#: autonick.py:233
msgid "The word '{word}' has been removed from the forbidden list."
msgstr "La palabra '{word}' ha sido eliminada de la lista de prohibidos."

#: autonick.py:237
msgid ""
"Show every forbidden word or phrase.\n"
"        Example: `/autonick admin listforbidden`\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"        Muestra la lista de todas las palabras o frases prohibidas.\n"
"        Ejemplo: `/autonick admin listforbidden`\n"
"        "

#: autonick.py:242
msgid "The forbidden words list is empty."
msgstr "La lista de palabras prohibidas está vacía."

#: autonick.py:246
msgid "Forbidden words"
msgstr "Palabras prohibidas"

#: i18n_strings.py:11
msgid ""
"Main AutoNick command group.\n"
"Use `/autonick help` to see every subcommand."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"        Grupo principal de comandos de AutoNick.\n"
"        Usa `/autonick help` para ver todos los subcomandos.\n"
"        "
